00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:04,000
别被广告忽悠了，
它其实就是戴了顶高帽子的福特嘉年华。
Don't be fooled by the ads,
it is a Ford Fiesta in a hat.

301
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,920
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

302
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:08,120
还有罗孚75长轴距版。
And the Rover 75 long wheelbase.

303
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:11,400
也就配给普雷斯顿市长坐坐。
Suitable only for the Mayor of Preston.

304
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,800
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

305
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:15,200
好了。我们有漏掉什么车吗？
Right. Have we missed
anything there or not?

306
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:18,680
观众男：SL55 AMG！
- 你觉得SL55 AMG毫无意……
MAN: SL55 AMG.
- SL55 AMG, you think, was a pointl-

307
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,280
你这家伙……
You...

308
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,920
[众人大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

309
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:31,280
那么，来看看真正的得主，
So, let's go to the actual winner,

310
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,480
它就是……
which is...

311
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:36,160
各位，是福特Fusion！
It's the Ford Fusion, everybody!

312
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,640
[掌声]
[APPLAUDING]

313
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,320
那么，呃……
Now, erm...

314
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,880
评委们对福特在这台车上
The judges were very impressed

315
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:46,440
展现出的极度怠惰印象深刻。
with Ford's idleness on this one.

316
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,920
他们明知道大家都喜欢小型MPV，
They knew that we all like Mini MPVs,

317
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,240
也明知道自己必须造一台出来，
they knew they needed to make one,

318
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,440
但他们根本懒得费劲。
and they couldn't be bothered.

319
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:53,680
[观众哄笑]
[AUDIENCE TITTERING]

320
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,760
呃，接下来是一个极具人气的奖项，
Uh, next up, a very popular category here,

321
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,800
这是“最奇葩雷诺”奖项。
it's the "Weirdest Renault" category.

322
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,880
好的，年度最奇葩雷诺奖。
Okay, Weirdest Renault of the Year.

323
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,600
提名车型如下：
The nominees are as follows:

324
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:04,520
Vel Satis。这是一辆商务人士用车，
The Vel Satis. It's a businessman's car,

325
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:07,360
前提是你的公司是安然。
but only if your business is Enron.

326
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,760
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

327
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,960
梅甘娜（Mégane）。一辆家用轿车，
The Mégane. A family car,

328
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,960
前提是你家是奥斯本一家。
but only if your family is the Osbournes.

329
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,480
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

330
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:19,160
还有Avantime。这是一辆运动轿跑，
And the Avantime. It's a sporty coupé,

331
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:22,640
前提是你根本不想要一辆
运动的车，
but only if you don't want a car
that's sporty.

332
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,480
[观众轻笑]
- 也不想要轿跑。
[AUDIENCE TITTERING]
- Or a coupé.

333
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,720
而赢家，
And the winner,

334
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:30,400
年度最奇葩雷诺是……
the weirdest Renault of the year is...

335
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:32,680
秉承雷诺一贯纯正的疯癫风格，
In true mad Renault style,

336
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,520
它是——日产Micra！
it's the Nissan Micra.

337
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:36,840
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

338
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:38,880
评委们指出，这位设计师
The judges noted that the designer

339
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:41,520
笔里的墨水显然是剩得太多了。
had plainly got too much ink in his pen.

340
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,840
瞧瞧这车！“快住手吧，老兄！
Look at it! "Stop designing it, man!

341
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:46,080
离那台CAD电脑远点儿！
step away from the CAD-CAM unit.

342
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,360
你已经画完了！
you've finished!

343
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:49,880
一辆车上堆这么多细节足够了！”
that's enough details on one car!"

344
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,160
现在到了重头戏。
Now the big one.

345
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:55,600
我们的“你真缺这点钱吗”大奖。
Our "Surely You Don't
Need The Money" award.

346
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:57,720
获奖者是……
And the winner is...

347
00:15:57,760 --> 00:16:01,760
埃迪·埃尔文，因为他代言了眼前这根浇花水管。
Eddie Irvine for promoting
this hose pipe here.

348
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:06,080
[口哨声]
[WHISTLING]

349
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:10,720
这人去年赚了600万英镑，整整600万啊，
The man earned £6 million
last year, £6 million,

350
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:12,680
居然还觉得把自己的大脸盘子
but still thought it was a good idea

351
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:15,280
印在这个包装盒上是个好主意，
to put his physog on this box,

352
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:20,400
而这玩意在Woolworths只卖79.99镑。
which is available in Woolworths
for £79.99.

353
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:22,560
好，在这个环节我们原本打算颁发
Now, we were going to
make an award at this point

354
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,280
我们赛道的最速圈速奖，
for the fastest car around our track,

355
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,800
得主是Radical，
which is the Radical,

356
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:28,720
跑出了惊人的1分19秒。
with an amazing time of
one minute, 19 seconds.

357
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:31,480
但是，德国人好像
But, it seems that the Germans

358
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,880
一直在暗中盯着我们的节目。
have been monitoring our broadcasts.

359
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,880
他们找上门来说，
And they got in touch and they said that

360
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:39,240
他们手里有两辆车，他们觉得
they've got a couple of cars
which they think

361
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,440
能血洗我们的赛道。
could blitzkrieg our track.

362
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,600
这是AS1。
This is the AS1.

363
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:46,640
它搭载的是摩托车发动机，
It's powered by a bike engine,

364
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:49,040
就是铃木“隼”上的那款引擎，
the same Suzuki Hayabusa unit

365
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:51,400
之前我们在Radical
和Westfield上也见识过。
that we saw in the Radical
and in the Westfield.

366
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,920
它这……呃……
It's, erm...

367
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,800
在哪儿呢？
Where is it?

368
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:59,320
没影了。呃……
It's gone. Erm...

369
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:04,360
好吧，不管藏哪儿，他们都给扩缸
到了1.4升。
Well, wherever it is they've bored it out
to 1.4 litres.

370
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,000
听着好像排量不大，
Now, that doesn't sound like much,

371
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:10,480
但这台AS1自重只有600公斤。
but the AS1 only weighs 600kg.

372
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,760
也就跟我脚上的鞋差不多沉。
That's the same as my shoes.

373
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:16,560
所以它理应跑得飞起。
So it SHOULD go like stink.

374
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:19,280
不过，我对那台更感兴趣。
However, I'm more interested in that.

375
00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:23,640
看着就像台普通的奥迪TT，
上面就贴了几张贴纸。
It looks like a normal Audi TT,
with a few stickers on it.

376
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:26,480
装的也是普通的奥迪TT发动机，
And it has a normal Audi TT engine,

377
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:29,880
1.8升带涡轮增压。
1.8 litres with a turbo charger.

378
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:31,800
但关键在于，
它被稍微调校了一下，
Thing is, though,
it's been tweaked a little bit,

379
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:35,600
以至于现在能爆发出400匹马力。
so that it now develops 400bhp.

380
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:38,920
好家伙，这都赶上一台法拉利360了。
Now, that's the same as a Ferrari 360.

381
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:41,360
要是普通的TT，发动机驱动的是
Now, in a normal TT, the engine drives

382
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,960
全部四个轮子。
all four wheels.

383
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:46,600
但在这台车上，发动机
只负责驱动前轮。
But in this, the engine
drives the front wheels.

384
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:48,800
后轮则是由
The rear wheels are driven

385
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:50,960
后备箱里藏的一个小玩意儿来驱动。
by a little something in the boot.

386
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:55,240
又一台400马力的发动机！
Another 400hp engine!

387
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:57,200
它装了两台发动机！
It's got two engines!

388
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,880
800匹马力！
800hp!

389
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:01,600
那我显然必须得上去爽一把！
Obviously, I have to have a go!

390
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,560
噢吼！
Oh-ho!

391
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:07,400
顶得生疼！
That hurts!

392
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,560
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

393
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:12,920
现在来看看操控怎么样……哎哟！
Now let's see how it handles... ooh!

394
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:15,520
过弯的时候最好把眼睛闭上。
Corners are best taken with your eyes shut.

395
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,800
这是我的独家建议。
That's my tip.

396
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:20,880
两台发动机，简直荒唐透顶。
Two engines. It's ridiculous.

397
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,720
油费翻了一倍，
Twice the fuel bills,

398
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:27,840
但不得不说，快乐也是翻倍的。
but, must be said, twice the fun.

399
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,240
爽！
Great!

400
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:34,400
但现在，这几台车必须接受严酷考验了。
But these cars must now face the acid test.

401
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:37,420
掌声有请，德意志斯提格！
Bitte wilkommen sie, Das Stig!

402
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:40,520
首先登场的是 AS1。
And it's the AS1 first.

403
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:43,880
但这车没装音响，
所以斯提格心情很差。
But it's got no stereo,
so The Stig's in a bad mood.

404
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,840
看着可能不算快，
Now, it may not look fast,

405
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,280
但这车身过弯几乎没有任何侧倾。
but it's got hardly any body roll at all.

406
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:51,920
瞧瞧它切过锤头弯时
车身有多平稳。
Just look how flat it stays
through the Hammerhead.

407
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:54,560
好了，马上要逼近轮胎墙了。
Right. We're coming up to the tyres now.

408
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:57,520
天呐，这速度简直快绝了。
Boy, that is so fast.

409
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:59,600
收油时排气管喷出了一点火花，
Bit of flame there on the over-run

410
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,760
正在逼近最后两个弯角。
as it comes up to the last two corners.

411
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:03,960
车尾晃了一下，但他救回来了，
Bit twitchy there, but he holds it,

412
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:07,080
切入最后一个弯，冲线！
into the last one and across the line.

413
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,720
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

414
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:11,400
接下来是这台狂暴的双引擎 TT，
Next, the mighty double-engined TT

415
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,680
大直道上快如闪电，
which is fast on the straights,

416
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,400
但弯道表现就差点意思了。
but not so good in the corners.

417
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,440
而且又是一台没装音响的。
And yet again no stereo.

418
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,560
斯提格估计要气炸了，
The Stig's going to be very cross

419
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,200
正杀进锤头弯。
as he comes into the Hammerhead.

420
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,800
瞧这阵势，
进气格栅好像都给跑飞了。
Lost the radiator grille,
by the looks of things.

421
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,480
排气管喷出了一大团烈焰，
A big, big burst of flame there

422
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,000
切进最后一个弯角，
as he comes into the final corner

423
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:29,040
这表现绝对配得上今年的圣诞大骨头。
and he's really earned his Christmas bone.

424
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:31,480
干得漂亮，德国人，
确实是下了番苦功夫。
Well done, the Germans,
that was a very good effort.

425
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:34,080
来看圈速。这是我们的超级跑车
圈速榜。
So the times. Here is our power car
laptime board.

426
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:37,000
排在榜首的是英国造的 Radical，
And at the top, there's the British Radical

427
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,320
跑出了惊人的1分19秒。
with an amazing 1:19.

428
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:40,680
非常非常棒的一台车。
Very, very good car.

429
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,680
那么，来看看德国人的表现如何，好吗？
So, let's see how the Germans did, okay?

430
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,640
首先是 MTM Bimoto，
First of all, the MTM Bimoto

431
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,040
搭载双引擎的那台。
with its two engines.

432
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:48,320
全是德国人搞的高端聪明玩意儿。
All very, very clever stuff
from the Germans.

433
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:50,960
呃，成绩是 5 比 1。
（1966年世界杯决赛）
Er, time was 5 - 1.
(1966 World Cup Final)

434
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,720
不对！
那不是圈速，那是球赛比分！
No!
That's not it; that's a score.

435
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:53,920
搞什么……那是比分。
What made... that's the score.

436
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:56,560
成绩是 19点45。
- 是 19点66 吧？
19:45 was the time.
- 19:66?

437
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:58,080
不是，不对。
- 又搞错了。
No, no.
- That's wrong again.

438
00:19:58,120 --> 00:20:00,400
实际成绩是 1分28秒，
It's actually 1:28,

439
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:02,640
这成绩非常、非常出色。
which is very, very good.

440
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,520
这比兰博基尼还要快，
That puts it faster than a Lamborghini,

441
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:08,400
比英国的Radical慢了大约整整9秒。
and about nine seconds
slower than the British Radical.

442
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,840
行了。那AS1呢？
There we are. So what about the AS1?

443
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,520
又是德国人搞出来的一台很灵巧的小车。
Very clever little car
again from the Germans.

444
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:16,000
跑出了让人眼前一亮的1分29秒。
That managed it in at an impressive 1:29.

445
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:18,720
天哪。
- 这成绩已经相当值得表扬了。
Oh, dear.
- Which is a very commendable effort.

446
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:19,920
克拉克森：哎呀天哪。
CLARKSON: Oh, dear.

447
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:22,040
还是不如英国的Radical快，
Not as quick as the British Radical,

448
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:24,560
人家依然稳坐本季最快圈速宝座，
which remains the fastest car of the series

449
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:27,120
成绩是1分19秒。
- 大好消息。
at 1.19.
- Great news.

450
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,200
好了。两周之前，
Okay. Now, a couple of weeks ago,

451
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:33,800
我们在赛道上办了一场比赛，
想测出“全英国开得最快的宗教”。
we had a race on our track
to find Britain's fastest faith.

452
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:36,560
最终由英国国教会拔得头筹。
And it was won by the Church of England.

453
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,840
可问题是，当时没有穆斯林参赛，
Trouble is no Muslim took part

454
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:42,160
因为我们拍那期节目的时候正赶上斋月。
because when we filmed the item
it was Ramadan.

455
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,840
而在斋月期间，穆斯林不仅不能进食，
And during Ramadan, Muslims are forbidden

456
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:48,520
还禁止参加任何形式的赛车运动。
from eating or taking part
in any form of motor sport.

457
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,640
不过，我非常高兴地宣布，
However, I'm delighted to say

458
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,960
现在斋月总算过完了，
that Ramadan is now over,

459
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:56,480
所以今天Top Gear大本营请来了一位穆斯林！
so we have a Muslim in the Top Gear base!

460
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,880
而且还不止穆斯林。
And not just a Muslim.

461
00:20:57,920 --> 00:21:00,720
我们还请来了一位德鲁伊、一位雷鬼教徒，
We also have a druid, and a Rastafarian,

462
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:03,240
外加一位基督复临安息日会信徒！
and a Seventh-Day Adventist!

